      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_persectur": "Persecutor",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_persectur_Description": "Attacks slow enemies based on how much mana they are missing. Min slow at %mana_threshold%%% mana, up to max slow at 0%% mana. No effect if enemy is above %mana_threshold%%% mana.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_persectur_Note0": "Full effect if caused by illusions.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_persectur_move_slow_min": "%MIN MOVEMENT SLOW:",
