      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_blink": "Blink",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_blink_Description": "Short distance teleportation that allows Anti-Mage to move in and out of combat.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_blink_Lore": "In his encounter with the Dead Gods, Anti-Mage learned the value of being elusive.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_blink_Note0": "You can use Blink to dodge incoming projectiles.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_blink_scepter_Description": "After casting Blink, your next Mana Break within %empowered_mana_break_duration%s burns an additional %empowered_max_burn_pct_tooltip%%% max mana and prevents the target from regenerating or gaining mana for a short duration. This debuff is undispellable.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_blink_empowered_mana_break_debuff_duration_tooltip": "DEBUFF DURATION:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_ally": "Counterspell Ally",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_ally_Facet_antimage_magebanes_mirror": "Counterspell burns a percentage of the countered spell's mana cost from its caster and does damage based on %damage_from_mana_drain_percent%%% of the burned mana cost, up to a maximum of %max_damage_from_mana_drain% damage per reflected spell.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_ally_Description": "Counterspell Ally may be activated to create an anti-magic shell around an allied hero that blocks and reflects any targeted spells. Any time a spell is blocked by Counterspell or Counterspell Ally, an illusion of Anti-Mage will be created next to the enemy.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_ally_Lore": "The only magic that Anti-Mage will even barely tolerate... is friendship.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_ally_duration": "DURATION:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell": "Counterspell",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_Facet_antimage_magebanes_mirror": "Counterspell burns a percentage of the countered spell's mana cost from its caster and does damage based on %damage_from_mana_drain_percent%%% of the burned mana cost, up to a maximum of %max_damage_from_mana_drain% damage per reflected spell.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_shard_Description": "Creates a blinked fragment of Anti-Mage next to the enemy caster upon reflecting their unit-targeted spell while active.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_Description": "Passively grants magic resistance. Counterspell may be activated to create an anti-magic shell around Anti-Mage that blocks and reflects any targeted spells.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_Lore": "With the proper focus, Anti-Mage turns innate resistance into calculated retaliation.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_Note0": "Break disables the passive magic resistance.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_magic_resistance": "MAGIC RESISTANCE:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_duration": "DURATION:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_counterspell_reflected_spell_amp": "REFLECTED SPELL AMP:",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_mana_void": "Mana Void",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_mana_void_Description": "For each point of mana missing by the target unit, damage is dealt to it and surrounding enemies.  The main target is also mini-stunned.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_mana_void_Facet_antimage_mana_thirst": "Passively grants attack damage when an enemy hero's mana falls below %min_bonus_pct%%%, with the bonuses increasing as their mana falls further.<br><br> If the enemies mana falls below %threshold_pct%%% Anti-Mage gains the maximum amount of damage, as well as vision and True Sight of that hero. Applies to enemy heroes within %thirst_range% range. Bonuses stack per hero.",
      "DOTA_Tooltip_ability_antimage_mana_void_Lore": "After bringing enemies to their knees, Anti-Mage punishes them for their use of the arcane arts.",
